      "problem": "$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix above. Find its decomposition using Jordan blocks.",
